; village_garden.room - the waterfall garden above the mill (design drafts/camada_pessoal.md section 1;
; architecture/story-05-playable-flashbacks). Entered from lake_waterfall_path's west stub (rows 5-8, floor row 9).
; A grass floor between rock walls; the pool (cols 27-32, row 9) is shallow water `s` under the waterfall, which
; falls from the rock ledge over the east end (rows 0-3): no hazard, Ivo wades (twin rule: garden_past.room). Left to right the dressing marks the old tree and its
; swing, the flower beds, the flat stone at the pool's west lip (col 25) and the waterfall (Contents/Marks).
; No bench, no creatures. Its well is GardenWell in home_village.tscn.

